    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Game-owned lookup for Text IDs on a workflow. Tryll does not own a string table. The class is chosen in Project Settings → Tryll Client → Text Provider. None means prompts stay inline and the Tryll Locale field is the session language. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
